Subject: [PATCH] webgl: let the launcher pin the vendor and renderer strings

Stock Chromium reports "WebKit" and "WebKit WebGL" for GL_VENDOR and
GL_RENDERER, and the driver strings through WEBGL_debug_renderer_info. This adds
--fingerprint-webgl-vendor and --fingerprint-webgl-renderer, forwards both to the
renderer, and reads them at all four query points. Without either switch the
upstream strings are returned unchanged.

Nanfu-Patch-Applies-To: 155.0.8059.85
Nanfu-Patch-Promise: third_party/blink/common/switches.cc::"fingerprint-webgl-vendor"

